88-2004&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fzh.wikipedia.org%3A%E8%A1%8C%E6%98%9F%E9%9A%9B%E5%A1%B5%E9%9B%B2&amp;rft.atitle=A+Solar+System+Dust+Ring+with+the+Earth+as+its+Shepherd&amp;rft.au=Jackson+A.A.%3B+Zook%2C+H.A.&amp;rft.date=1988&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=Nature&amp;rft.pages=629&amp;rft.volume=337&amp;rft_id=info%3Adoi%2F10.1038%2F337629a0&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal\">\n    <span style=\"display:none;\">\n    </span>\n   </span>\n  </p>\n  <p>\n   <link href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r92366446\" rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\"/>\n   <cite class=\"citation journal\">\n    Jackson A.A.; Zook, H.A. Orbital evolution of dust particles from comets and asteroids. Icarus. 1992,\n    <b>\n     97\n    </b>\n    : 70–84.\n    <a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//doi.org/10.1016%2F0019-1035%2892%2990057-E\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1016%2F0019-1035%2892%2990057-E\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n     <span title=\"數位物件識別號\">\n      doi:10.1016/0019-1035(92)90057-E\n     </span>\n    </a>\n    .\n   </cite>\n   <span class=\"Z3988\" title=\"ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fzh.wikipedia.org%3A%E8%A1%8C%E6%98%9F%E9%9A%9B%E5%A1%B5%E9%9B%B2&amp;rft.atitle=Orbital+evolution+of+dust+particles+from+comets+and+asteroids&amp;rft.au=Jackson+A.A.%3B+Zook%2C+H.A.&amp;rft.date=1992&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=Icarus&amp;rft.pages=70-84&amp;rft.volume=97&amp;rft_id=info%3Adoi%2F10.1016%2F0019-1035%2892%2990057-E&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal\">\n    <span style=\"display:none;\">\n    </span>\n   </span>\n  </p>\n  <p>\n   <link href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r92366446\" rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\"/>\n   <cite class=\"citation conference\">\n    Backman, Dana. Exozody Workshop, NASA-Ames, October 23–25, 1997. Extrasolar Zodiacal Emission - NASA Study Panel Report. 1997.\n   </cite>\n   <span class=\"Z3988\" title=\"ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fzh.wikipedia.org%3A%E8%A1%8C%E6%98%9F%E9%9A%9B%E5%A1%B5%E9%9B%B2&amp;rft.au=Backman%2C+Dana&amp;rft.btitle=Extrasolar+Zodiacal+Emission+-+NASA+Study+Panel+Report&amp;rft.date=1997&amp;rft.genre=conference&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook\">\n    <span style=\"display:none;\">\n    </span>\n   </span>\n  </p>\n  <p>\n   See:\n   <a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20050510232920/http://astrobiology.arc.nasa.gov/workshops/zodiac/backman/backman.txt\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    NASA Panel Report on Extrasolar Zodiacal Emission\n   </a>\n  </p>\n  <p>\n   <link href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r92366446\" rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\"/>\n   <cite class=\"citation journal\">\n    Dermott, S.F. Jayaraman, S., Xu, Y.L., Gustafson, A.A.S., Liou, J.C.,. RA circumsolar ring of asteroid dust in resonant lock with the Earth. Nature. June 30, 1994,\n    <b>\n     360\n    </b>\n    : 79–?.\n   </cite>\n   <span class=\"Z3988\" title=\"ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fzh.wikipedia.org%3A%E8%A1%8C%E6%98%9F%E9%9A%9B%E5%A1%B5%E9%9B%B2&amp;rft.atitle=RA+circumsolar+ring+of+asteroid+dust+in+resonant+lock+with+the+Earth&amp;rft.au=Dermott%2C+S.F.+Jayaraman%2C+S.%2C+Xu%2C+Y.L.%2C+Gustafson%2C+A.A.S.%2C+Liou%2C+J.C.%2C&amp;rft.date=1994-06-30&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=Nature&amp;rft.pages=79-%3F&amp;rft.volume=360&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal\">\n    <span style=\"display:none;\">\n    </span>\n   </span>\n  </p>\n  <p>\n   <link href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r92366446\" rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\"/>\n   <cite class=\"citation conference\">\n    Dermott, S.F. Signatures of Planets in Zodiacal Light. Extrasolar Zodiacal Emission - NASA Study Panel Report. 1997.\n   </cite>\n   <span class=\"Z3988\" title=\"ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fzh.wikipedia.org%3A%E8%A1%8C%E6%98%9F%E9%9A%9B%E5%A1%B5%E9%9B%B2&amp;rft.au=Dermott%2C+S.F.&amp;rft.btitle=Extrasolar+Zodiacal+Emission+-+NASA+Study+Panel+Report&amp;rft.date=19